WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.755
Emmy and Harry were going outside to play.

2
00:00:05.756 --> 00:00:10.100
"Wait a minute, you two!" said Mom.

3
00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:13.058
"Today is Chores Day."

4
00:00:13.059 --> 00:00:18.093
Emmy and Harry groaned.

5
00:00:18.094 --> 00:00:21.543
"Please dust all the furniture," said Mom.

6
00:00:21.544 --> 00:00:24.580
"I'll sweep all the floors."

7
00:00:24.581 --> 00:00:31.966
Harry got the feather dusters.

8
00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:38.776
Emmy and Harry started dusting tables and chairs.

9
00:00:38.777 --> 00:00:42.412
"This will take forever," groaned Emmy.

10
00:00:42.413 --> 00:00:46.678
Soon Oliver and Tom ran into the room.

11
00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:56.438
"We're space rangers!" shouted Oliver.

12
00:00:56.439 --> 00:00:59.564
"Watch out, Tom!" Oliver yelled.

13
00:00:59.565 --> 00:01:06.648
"Here come some evil aliens!"

14
00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:09.759
Tom started to run away.

15
00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.681
Then he spotted Emmy's feather duster.

16
00:01:12.682 --> 00:01:15.833
"What's that?" asked Tom.

17
00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:19.681
Emmy had an idea.

18
00:01:19.682 --> 00:01:23.790
"It's a special space wand," she said.

19
00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:27.656
"It stops aliens."

20
00:01:27.657 --> 00:01:31.441
"How does it work?" asked Tom.

21
00:01:31.442 --> 00:01:34.053
Emmy showed him.

22
00:01:34.054 --> 00:01:37.678
"You dust all the furniture.

23
00:01:37.679 --> 00:01:42.995
That makes the aliens go away."

24
00:01:42.996 --> 00:01:46.275
"Can I have your space wand?" asked Tom.

25
00:01:46.276 --> 00:01:48.817
"Um . . . ," said Emmy.

26
00:01:48.818 --> 00:01:54.335
She pretended to think for a minute.

27
00:01:54.336 --> 00:01:59.135
"Okay."

28
00:01:59.136 --> 00:02:03.829
Oliver looked at Harry.

29
00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:12.925
"Can I have your space wand, please?"

30
00:02:12.926 --> 00:02:14.622
"I guess so. . ."

31
00:02:14.623 --> 00:02:18.440
Harry handed it over.

32
00:02:18.441 --> 00:02:22.349
Oliver dusted the tables with his space wand.

33
00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:28.873
Tom dusted the chairs.

34
00:02:28.874 --> 00:02:38.178
"Good-bye, evil aliens!" cried the boys.

35
00:02:38.179 --> 00:02:42.400
But Emmy and Harry couldn't hear them.

36
00:02:42.401 --> 00:03:01.967
Emmy and Harry were outside, playing.

